\end{pmatrix} $, as follows.
\begin{align*}
   UAU^{-1} &= \begin{pmatrix}
 1&2&1&2\\
 3&4&2&1\\
 4&5&3&2\\
 1&6&2&7
\end{pmatrix}
\begin{pmatrix}
 29/2&24&12&33/2\\
 -1/2&-2&-1&-7/2\\
 -43/2&-34&-17&-41/2\\
 9/2&8&4&13/2
\end{pmatrix}
\begin{pmatrix}
 7&5/2&-3&-3/2&\\
 -2&1/2&0&1/2\\
 -8&-9/2&5&3/2\\
