        "A matrix-kernel certificate {\"coefficients\": [c_0,...,c_(m-1)]}: "
        "exactly m integers in [-3,3], not all zero, primitive (gcd 1), with "
        "the first nonzero coefficient positive."
    ),
    "bounds": {
